-- title:
--   From HTo GAdjacent Stage M3 Pointwise Final Left Shape
-- statement:
--   **The pointwise M3 stage has the final left-action shape.** Fix a slice height $x$, a tuple of remaining points $xs$, a stage index $\ell$, and let $n=k-(\ell+1)$. Write $S$ for the recurrence weight, $U$ for the G-hat outcome operator, and $T$ for the G-hat half-product operator. Let $\mathcal I$ be the type-filtered set of outcome and tuple pairs and $\mathcal U$ the corresponding unrestricted set. With $L$ and $R$ denoting left and right tensor placement, the pointwise identity is
--
--   $$
--   \sum_{(g,gs)\in\mathcal I}
--   \operatorname{ev}_{\psi}\!\left(L(TT^{\dagger}U)R(SU)\right)
--   =
--   \sum_{(g,gs)\in\mathcal U}
--   \operatorname{ev}_{\psi}\!\left(\bigl(L(TT^{\dagger})R(SU)\bigr)L(U)\right).
--   $$
--
--   The filtered index set encodes the Boolean outcome and G-hat type conditions from the formal statement. This is the pointwise algebraic endpoint of the last move-right rewrite for the M3 stage.
--
--   Formalization credit: Sirui Lu, Ruixuan Deng, Yanqiao Zhu, and Zhengfeng Ji (arXiv:2609.19814). Mathematical source: Zhengfeng Ji, Anand Natarajan, Thomas Vidick, John Wright, and Henry Yuen (arXiv:2009.12982).
--
--   **Formalization Note.** The source declaration is `MIPStarRE.LDT.Pasting.fromHToGAdjacentStageM3_pointwise_finalLeftShape`; its Lean statement gives the exact quantifier order and all boundary hypotheses.
